WEBVTT

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:16.570
Majic... was it?

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:19.070
I guess you didn't go with him.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:21.190
Him? You mean my master?

00:00:21.190 --> 00:00:25.530
Yeah. Everyone knows about him around here.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:27.400
What are you trying to say?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.070
I'll fill you in on his legend.

00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:33.480
You can figure out how
you feel about him after that.

00:00:34.690 --> 00:00:37.860
Five years ago, Krylancelo killed someone...

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:40.780
Or rather, he almost killed someone.

00:00:40.780 --> 00:00:42.780
A Sorcerer from the tower.

00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:44.360
Master did?

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.780
Krylancelo was nominated
to be one of the Thirteen Apostles

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:51.980
and could've become
the youngest court Sorcerer in history.

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:56.780
But it wasn't meant to be.

00:00:56.780 --> 00:01:01.730
Back then, the Tower of Fangs released
too many Sorcerers to the court

00:01:01.730 --> 00:01:04.940
and things were starting to deteriorate.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:08.820
So then the elders happened
to scout a Sorcerer named Childman,

00:01:08.820 --> 00:01:11.860
though they didn't know where he had come from.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:14.940
They had him take in children
who had potential as students

00:01:14.940 --> 00:01:18.650
and tried to mass produce powerful Sorcerers.

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:21.650
And Master was one of those Sorcerers?

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:25.900
Correct. That class
was called the Childman Class,

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:29.190
and they were considered
one of the best in the whole tower.

00:01:29.190 --> 00:01:34.980
And within that class Krylancelo was
called "the Successor of the Razor's Edge."

00:01:34.980 --> 00:01:36.980
Just like the name suggests,

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:42.570
Childman had passed down all of
his assassination and fighting skills to him.

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:48.070
It's no surprise that the elders
didn't think the court should have him.

00:01:48.070 --> 00:01:50.360
What I'm about to say is just my theory,

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.230
but I think Krylancelo wanted
to become one of the Thirteen Apostles.

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:56.530
In order to stop that,

00:01:56.530 --> 00:02:00.480
the elders sent someone after him
as he was heading to the royal capital.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:02.030
But he...

00:02:04.940 --> 00:02:11.900
...left that messenger for dead and
couldn't become one of the Thirteen Apostles.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:16.820
I think that's the reason
he cut ties with the Tower of Fangs.

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:20.280
Something like that would
make it hard for him to return.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.780
Master's not like that at all!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:58.000
"Make My Past Disappear, Assassin"

00:04:02.280 --> 00:04:04.230
Hey, that's Flip's shop.

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:05.900
I guess it's still there.

00:04:05.900 --> 00:04:10.610
Come to think of it, this is the first time
I'm walking through the city alone.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:14.440
There was always someone with me.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.480
I was called the best at just 15,

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:22.070
but my one downfall was I couldn't kill anyone.

00:04:22.070 --> 00:04:26.860
When you fight someone,
don't think of trying to surpass them.

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:31.360
Because if you run into someone
stronger than you, you won't stand a chance.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:34.610
More importantly, find your opponent's weakness.

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:39.070
Once you find their weakness,
don't be scared to follow through.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:43.530
If they have even one weakness,
your opportunities are endless.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:51.570
We might never be able
to live up to your expectations.

00:04:51.570 --> 00:04:54.860
If we actually grew up
just like you wanted us to,

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:57.650
I would've ended up as that Krylancelo.

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.900
I have to fight myself that has no flaws.

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:06.190
That's the truth that scares me.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:13.030
It's as though I'm forced
to see that I'm actually defective.

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:16.940
I might be defective, but I'm also incomplete.

00:05:16.940 --> 00:05:21.110
I'm challenging you, Childman.

00:05:22.980 --> 00:05:25.070
Where do you think you're going?

00:05:25.070 --> 00:05:27.900
Master...

00:05:27.900 --> 00:05:30.730
He went to fight with that assassin, right?

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:34.110
You should probably cut ties
with someone that dangerous.

00:05:34.110 --> 00:05:36.690
Krylancelo is my precious little brother

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:39.730
and someone you should respect.

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:42.730
It's true that he's a bit sloppy now, but...

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:45.280
If you say so...

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:46.360
Let's go.

00:05:46.360 --> 00:05:48.780
Oh... Right!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:53.610
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.980
I guess I'll just go all out.

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:05.320
I scale thee, Heavenly Snowy Mountain!

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:19.860
Sorry, but I don't plan
to spend that much time with you.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:23.480
Is this a coincidence?
No, you must've guessed I'd show up.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:27.070
Yeah. I mean, as soon as I figured
out what you were thinking,

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:30.190
transferring here only took an instant.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.530
Is Claiomh safe?

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:35.980
She is, but you won't be able to save her.

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.570
Or that Deep Dragon.

00:06:38.570 --> 00:06:40.820
Well, aren't you confident.

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:47.400
Yeah... I'm pretty sure you've probably
figured out who I am by now, Orphen.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.530
Or should I say, the original Krylancelo!

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:52.900
Don't fight him yet.
I still don't know his weakness.

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:56.480
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:06:58.030 --> 00:07:00.940
Guide my path, Deathsong Starling!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:04.610
I crush thee, Primordial Silence!

00:07:10.780 --> 00:07:14.730
That blow should've been
enough to take out most of the roof...

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:17.280
Looks like you're finally letting loose,

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:21.150
but you're still naïve.

00:07:21.150 --> 00:07:23.280
Not even a scratch, I see.

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:29.780
You might've won if you aimed
directly for me, rather than the roof.

00:07:29.780 --> 00:07:33.650
Though I don't think
you're capable of doing that.

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:37.230
You won't be able to
defeat me unless you kill me.

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:38.480
I--

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:42.320
I'll just tell you one thing...

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:46.690
The reason I have to fight you.

00:07:46.690 --> 00:07:48.230
Azalie.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:52.480
Did Azalie tell you to go that far?

00:07:52.480 --> 00:07:55.190
No, this is my own decision.

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:58.190
Apparently, she needs you.

00:07:58.190 --> 00:08:03.940
She thinks that you'll return
to your former self by fighting me.

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:09.070
But I have my own reason for fighting you.

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:13.730
You cannot go back to being your former self.

00:08:13.730 --> 00:08:16.570
You'll just end up hurting her!

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:21.030
Not to mention... She has me!

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:29.320
I call upon thee, Tiny Spirits!

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:32.280
There's no need for two Krylancelos!

00:08:37.650 --> 00:08:39.030
I unsheathe thee...

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:40.650
Embrace my surroundings...

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:43.070
--...Sword of Light!
--...Dancing Bronco!

00:08:44.780 --> 00:08:46.320
What?!

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:49.900
Don't fight so seriously!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:53.400
There's no point in risking
your life fighting some assassin.

00:08:53.400 --> 00:08:55.150
Is that so?!

00:09:01.730 --> 00:09:03.150
Why you--

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:10.070
That's what happens
when you let your guard down.

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:15.440
You can fix any cuts with Sorcery,
but you can't replace any blood that's lost.

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:20.280
True. I repair thee, Scars of the Sunset.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.030
You seem prepared.

00:09:28.030 --> 00:09:30.440
I sure hope so.

00:09:30.440 --> 00:09:34.360
But you won't fight me seriously. Is that it?

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:39.150
I'd been thinking this whole time...
For ways to outsmart you.

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:41.230
I thought of three different ways.

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:42.900
That was the first one.

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:45.400
And it'll never work on me again.

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:49.570
I know. That's why I thought of various ways.

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.320
The second one is...

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:01.730
You won't be able to avoid a concussion!

00:10:04.280 --> 00:10:06.780
This is the end, Krylancelo.

00:10:08.570 --> 00:10:12.530
Is that all you've got? Don't underestimate me.

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:20.940
It's been 30 minutes since the first report.

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:22.730
It's quiet now.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:24.230
Should we charge?

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:26.690
You look troubled, Captain.

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:27.780
You're...

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:30.780
The ones fighting in there are Sorcerers.

00:10:30.780 --> 00:10:33.150
I'll handle them.

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:35.940
That'd be great if you would.

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.780
We're breaking in there.

00:10:42.360 --> 00:10:45.610
You've become a great man.

00:10:49.530 --> 00:10:51.730
Azalie!

00:10:51.730 --> 00:10:54.480
You've been keeping
an eye on me this whole time.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:59.900
Since you're also a White Sorcerer,
you can send over a mental projection.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:05.280
You're a danger to her, as well.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:07.190
Even though you may not realize it,

00:11:07.190 --> 00:11:12.400
you're undoubtedly
the Successor of the Razor's Edge.

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:15.230
I'm sure you remember this room.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.070
Yeah.

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.440
Runes?

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:26.570
Childman had passed on the knowledge
and legacy of Ancient Sorcery to her.

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:29.280
Though you probably didn't know that.

00:11:29.980 --> 00:11:32.030
Nornir's Legacy...

00:11:32.030 --> 00:11:36.230
If, within that legacy
was Nornir's greatest weapon,

00:11:36.230 --> 00:11:40.860
the Killing Doll, would you be surprised?

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:42.820
Killing Doll?

00:11:42.820 --> 00:11:45.980
The anti-Sorcerer killing machine.

00:11:45.980 --> 00:11:49.280
They have Nornir's
runes engraved in their bodies.

00:11:49.280 --> 00:11:52.150
Once those runes are written,
that would activate the Sorcery,

00:11:52.150 --> 00:11:55.280
and it can use Silent Sorcery.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:59.480
Yes... She'd been watching over you.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:02.570
And then, she activated me and controlled me.

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:15.820
The Sword of Baldanders!

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:22.360
She used this sword to
transform me into her ideal assassin!

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:28.150
Thanks to that, I can use
any technique that you have.

00:12:28.150 --> 00:12:30.730
At least, from the time she knew you.

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:40.650
Paralyzing Sorcery?

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:43.980
You wouldn't just abandon her
and run off, would you?

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:46.280
I don't plan on killing her,

00:12:46.280 --> 00:12:49.110
but who knows what'll happen
if I cut her with this sword?

00:12:49.110 --> 00:12:54.860
Do you think she'd cry if she woke up
and turned into a frog or a snake?

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:59.860
I was really hoping I wouldn't have
to use this third way to outsmart you...

00:13:03.320 --> 00:13:07.070
I guess I'm just dancing on
the palm of your hand, Childman!

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:24.030
That technique...
That was Childman's trump card.

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:29.230
My third way of outsmarting you

00:13:29.230 --> 00:13:37.110
was the fact that I'd be willing
to kill someone to save that tomboy.

00:13:37.110 --> 00:13:40.320
But you seem to be doing fine,
even when you lost blood,

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.440
so I thought it was weird...

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.650
But to think I was actually fighting a doll...

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:50.650
Be careful.

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:58.980
I can't be the one who holds everyone back.

00:13:58.980 --> 00:14:01.320
You're a handful. You know that?

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:05.320
To think that your last resort
would be as Orthodox as possible...

00:14:12.360 --> 00:14:19.070
But that just means that you'll be able
to fight on the same level as me.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.650
Do you really think that?

00:14:21.650 --> 00:14:26.730
Of course, I do. And I'm going to win, for her sake.

00:14:26.730 --> 00:14:32.070
For her sake this, for her sake that...
Is everything for Azalie?

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:37.900
It is! I only live for her!

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:40.480
I'm her ideal assassin!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.400
It really pisses me off
when you say stuff like that.

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:45.570
Come at me!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:48.610
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:54.900
I construct thee, Spire of the Sun!

00:14:56.190 --> 00:15:02.530
You fool! My body is able to withstand
even the Deep Dragon's Sorcery!

00:15:03.780 --> 00:15:06.980
Guide my path, Deathsong Starling!

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:19.900
I crush thee, Primordial Silence!

00:15:26.190 --> 00:15:29.150
You still have that much power left?

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:33.360
The real question is
if I'm going to be able to survive,

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:35.230
being in the middle of this blast.

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:38.860
I'm not going to lose! Especially for her sake!

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:43.610
And I'm not gonna lose to you, dumbass!

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:48.030
I have a mountain of things I want to say to you!

00:15:48.030 --> 00:15:53.900
For her sake? That's all it took
for you to abandon everything else?!

00:15:56.610 --> 00:16:01.230
There were plenty of others that needed you!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:04.570
I've been... searching for you...

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:09.070
I knew that you would...

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:11.940
You're nothing but a brat that
only knows the art of assassination!

00:16:11.940 --> 00:16:14.150
The reason you were scouted
to be one of the Thirteen Apostles

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:16.820
is because you were one of Master's students!

00:16:16.820 --> 00:16:20.980
For her... For her...

00:16:21.650 --> 00:16:23.610
For her sake!

00:16:23.610 --> 00:16:27.480
That's a lie. You were a clueless brat,

00:16:27.480 --> 00:16:31.570
so that's all you had to hold onto!

00:16:39.820 --> 00:16:43.730
Looks like the battle's over.

00:16:43.730 --> 00:16:45.320
Who won?

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:49.070
Majic.

00:16:49.070 --> 00:16:51.070
Uh, coming!

00:16:52.610 --> 00:16:56.190
Azalie... belongs only to me...

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:04.190
Poor, pathetic me...

00:17:08.070 --> 00:17:10.320
Krylancelo...

00:17:10.820 --> 00:17:12.070
Krylancelo...

00:17:12.070 --> 00:17:15.320
Stop it! Stop trying to control me!

00:17:17.900 --> 00:17:21.320
I guess it really doesn't work.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:23.150
Azalie!

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:25.860
Why did you kill the elders?

00:17:27.610 --> 00:17:29.730
Was it out of spite?

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.820
Why did you kill the ranger...

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.530
Why did you kidnap Claiomh?

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:38.730
I wasn't expecting that thing
to obtain a will of its own.

00:17:38.730 --> 00:17:42.360
To think that it'd do anything
other than what I ordered it to do...

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:43.440
Will of its own?

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:47.480
More importantly, there's something I have to do.

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:49.360
"More importantly"?!

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:53.780
O Chaos!

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:02.650
I wouldn't want to make
you a murderer, after all.

00:18:02.650 --> 00:18:06.980
Don't try to act like my friend
now after all you've done!

00:18:06.980 --> 00:18:11.820
Don't look at me like that.
To be honest, I was scared of you.

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:13.400
Scared...?

00:18:13.400 --> 00:18:17.400
I have a reason to be scared of you.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.360
You? Scared of me?

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:23.940
The Chaos Witch, who had the
most Sorcery in the Childman Class?

00:18:23.940 --> 00:18:25.610
Then just kill me.

00:18:25.610 --> 00:18:30.030
You had no problem killing
anyone else that got in your way.

00:18:30.030 --> 00:18:34.690
Krylancelo... I cannot kill you.

00:18:34.690 --> 00:18:38.070
Because you're the only one who's his successor.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:43.690
Do you remember when
you went to the royal capital?

00:18:43.690 --> 00:18:47.110
You left the elders' messenger for dead.

00:18:47.110 --> 00:18:50.480
That's when I thought there was a chance...

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:52.190
That was...

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:57.190
He tried to stop me
and said something really stupid.

00:18:57.190 --> 00:19:01.780
Don't tell me you took that seriously, Azalie.

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:05.940
Even Childman would never think that!

00:19:05.940 --> 00:19:11.400
Master was thoroughly training you
in the art of mental control.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:15.530
Just you, in this basement.

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:20.730
No one else has trained
in mental control as much as you.

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:23.150
Why could that be?

00:19:23.150 --> 00:19:26.570
It's because you were special.

00:19:26.570 --> 00:19:28.360
Stop it, Azalie!

00:19:28.360 --> 00:19:33.940
Childman was trying to raise you into
a trump card against White Sorcerers.

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:37.440
In order to keep me in check,
because I was the only one

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:40.400
in our class that had the potential
to surpass him, our master.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:43.900
You were trained to kill me.

00:19:43.900 --> 00:19:47.440
You're the only assassin
in the world who can actually kill me.

00:19:47.440 --> 00:19:49.610
That's enough!

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:52.570
There's no way Master actually thought that!

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:56.400
Even if that were the case, I'm not an assassin.

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:59.440
I love you. I've always admired you!

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:02.230
You were always there to guide me!

00:20:02.230 --> 00:20:03.780
I...

00:20:07.230 --> 00:20:14.280
Azalie, I just want you
to live in peace somewhere...

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:16.610
That's impossible.

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:17.730
Sister...

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:22.780
How many years has it been
since you last called me your sister?

00:20:22.780 --> 00:20:28.280
Even Tish has been waiting for
your return and prepared a room for you!

00:20:28.280 --> 00:20:30.860
You're not alone!

00:20:30.860 --> 00:20:33.860
It's impossible. I have my own plan.

00:20:33.860 --> 00:20:35.110
Plan?

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:40.530
I want to know what
Master Childman was thinking.

00:20:40.530 --> 00:20:44.030
Stay by my side, Krylancelo.

00:20:44.030 --> 00:20:48.730
If you're the only assassin that can kill me,

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:55.440
I'm the only one who can understand you
and be your partner and support you.

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.030
I...

00:20:57.030 --> 00:21:01.360
You'll have an answer
by the next time we meet, right?

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:06.030
If you're going to make a promise to a woman,

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:11.480
you need to be able to make
a woman listen to you, Krylancelo.

00:21:13.190 --> 00:21:17.860
Now, then... Looks like she's
waking up, so I'll take my leave.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:21.900
I'd love to see Tish,
but I need her to believe that I'm dead.

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:24.070
Until I go there, at least.

00:21:25.940 --> 00:21:27.690
Kimluck, that is.

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:31.730
Wait!

00:21:49.530 --> 00:21:51.230
Orphen?

00:21:53.570 --> 00:21:54.650
Master!

00:21:54.650 --> 00:21:55.820
Krylancelo!

00:21:55.820 --> 00:21:59.330
"Who is the true successor?"

00:21:55.940 --> 00:21:59.320
Master! Master!

00:23:37.980 --> 00:23:43.070
Whenever you leave me behind, it's when
you go somewhere dangerous, right, Orphen?

00:23:43.070 --> 00:23:46.980
I just don't want you causing any trouble!

00:23:44.980 --> 00:23:46.980
"The Uoar Class"
